ucture for industrial consumers. It serves pharmaceuticals, chemicals, agrochemicals, textiles, tyres, dyes and pigments, polymers, paints, food processing, paper, and other manufacturing sectors. Steamhouse India Limited was formerly known as Ankleshwar Eco Energy Limited and changed its name to Steamhouse India Limited in September 2021. Steamhouse India Limited was founded in 2014 and is based in Surat, India with additional offices in Ankleshwar, Vapi, Sarigam, Nandesari, and Panoli, India.","employees":null,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795529781},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795529781,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"STEAMHOUSE INDIA\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"STEAMHOUSE INDIA LIMITED Share Price - Live NSE: STEAMHOUSE Stock Price & Chart","s":"Upstox","d":1795492508,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTFBqTG5wMHlBQktyU2h3NUhBME12RG9WWmRPV1h4d0lNdTdlWHVaVHdTT3JjMjVFVDRLWURJMWU5T1RKbzFFaEY2U21kYWxjWnVMTDlFSVU2a0JqZlh6NHh5SXJJSWlpb194R3NUb2taS2s?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Steamhouse India Ltd. Share Price Today - Steamhouse India Ltd. Stock Price Live NSE/BSE","s":"CNBC TV18","d":1795427940,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxPSTM4cFpoRUdjMWF1bXJVd0hROVRFV1g3WWJvM1EzWXBfUU5pWUZDQWR5bHNGc2FtX0VmcG1WbEVkc1FXVWtfandiblVQZVhsZUdHMHpVcUttQXJYd1JzUGpidHpaRHpXaEgzcXQ1eFl1YlFQT1BZcF9RYmc0X1lEeVJfdWkyZw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Steamhouse India Limited (STEAMHOUSE.BO) balance sheet","s":"Yahoo Finance UK","d":1795168793,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE56X2VHcUpIb0ZiZTZYRFR5WDMwQ1dMY0ZQQXFLUVgzREY5ck92SXlRZTd0WGNLOFEtb0x2TFVBN1FUVDBmUzFOU3FfVXVPSGdfZ3Jza0x4UzdQS3lvblRLc1FrRHN2MUR5cVo3ZmVPWEc?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"STEAMHOUSE INDIA Share Price Today Near High, Valuation View","s":"Univest","d":1795161600,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNTDUyQnFuR1oxbG9GNnAzeDV2RUFVdFItTzktazlfZDhnUFJiRzZ1VzdEUENNQ203e